# Naby Bangoura is locked in!

It's official! He is coming to share his moves with us here on the Sunshine Coast. Alright dancers this is going to be great! Naby brings his incredible talent to Australia in November and we have locked him in for a weekend over the 14th/15th November. There will be dance workshops and of course a performance. This is a must see for all lovers of drum and dance! Get IT in your diary NOW!
